Warning [L0506]: hidden allocation inside `#Context` without an allocator
  --> tests/ui_lint/hidden_alloc_context.jet:4:12
    |
  4 |         xs.push(1)
    |            ^^^^
 Why: this call may allocate on the global heap while a scoped context is active
 Fix: add `allocator: …` to the `#Context(…)` fields, or move the allocation outside the block
